      "text": "Invariants",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Invariants",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uzXPSpkstJ9ArreDj3oLO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 745,
      "width": 886.13427734375,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2085027119,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867378,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Tenant comes from the route, subject and plan from the verified credential, never from the body",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Tenant comes from the route, subject and plan from the verified credential, never from the body",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "a-PFww82m8iat_LSKda69",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 777,
      "width": 778.1529541015625,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 227930433,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867379,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Credentials are verified against the raw body, before anything parses or rewrites it",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Credentials are verified against the raw body, before anything parses or rewrites it",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uTv_PyzpV9IB1fLzXRTqB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 809,
      "width": 921.7199096679688,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 871202639,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867379,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Quota is reserved before the run and settled after: failures refund, timeouts keep the reservation",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Quota is reserved before the run and settled after: failures refund, timeouts keep the reservation",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LzLyJL0l2zc7NOdGoTZnL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 841,
      "width": 901.8662109375,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1797792033,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867379,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Three limits: messages per subject (by plan), a monthly pool per tenant, and per IP for anonymous",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Three limits: messages per subject (by plan), a monthly pool per tenant, and per IP for anonymous",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "466J4buAEyg3eEM_84_r9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 873,
      "width": 808.7706909179688,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1405009263,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867380,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Stateless tenants store no content: the client sends the history, logs carry codes only",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Stateless tenants store no content: the client sends the history, logs carry codes only",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "83v97Y0hHzAgc_rcf6Sim",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 905,
      "width": 781.177001953125,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1521046785,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867380,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. AuthZ is two checks: may this subject do this action, and does it own this resource",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. AuthZ is two checks: may this subject do this action, and does it own this resource",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
